Subject: [PATCH 1273/3799] soh: rename func_800418D0 ->
 BgCheck_ResetDynaBgHeaders

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: its doc comment reads "SEGMENT_TO_VIRTUAL all active BgActor CollisionHeaders"; it re-resolves every live bg actor's collision header after the object segments move, which is why the pause menu and the save menu call it on close. "Reset" names that re-resolve pass.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_bgcheck.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
